5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin with grace. I believe observing how we handle the initial uncertainty will reveal much about our true natures.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A quiet start is often the most honest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best! I think being open and friendly is the best way to find the truth.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Emotional openness is subjective. I prefer to focus on logical inconsistencies and the timing of claims.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, Victoria, so serious! I think a little playfulness makes it easier to spot who's sweating under the pressure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Victoria, your rational approach is a pillar. However, @May, do you believe aggression is a tool for truth or a mask?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I think May is just being herself! But Servas has a point. Maybe the wolf will try to act too helpful?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. Over-compensation is a common tell. I will be watching for those who try too hard to lead the narrative.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"I'm just keeping things lively! If we're all as silent as Jonathan, we'll never find the wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Silence can be a sanctuary or a hiding place. We must distinguish between the two as the days progress.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer the sanctuary.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm starting to wonder if being too quiet is actually suspicious... sorry Jonathan!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"It is a valid hypothesis, Yumi. Lack of information is not evidence of innocence; it is simply a void.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,See? Even Yumi is noticing it. Maybe the quiet ones are just calculating their next move.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
