35,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We return to a full table, but the air has changed. Who among us feels the most burdened by the silence?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I feel no burden. I am simply observing.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm still a bit scared! I feel like we should talk more so we can trust each other.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Trust is a luxury. I have information that suggests we should look closely at those who deflect.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,May,,"@Victoria, that sounds like a threat! Why are you acting so mysterious? Are you trying to frame me?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, your reaction is quite sharp. @Victoria, if you have a lead, the village benefits from clarity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
