42,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, is May acting weird? Or is Jonathan being too cold? I can't tell!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I have confirmed that May is the werewolf. Logic dictates we execute her immediately to secure victory.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,May,,That is a blatant lie! I'm a villager! She's the one pretending to be the Seer to get rid of me!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Servas,,"A direct claim. @May, your desperation is palpable. @Victoria, your certainty is absolute.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
