47,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Victoria seems so sure... and May is getting really loud. I think I believe Victoria.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Victoria,,The evidence is binary. May is the wolf. There is no room for debate.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,May,,"You're all falling for it! Jonathan, help me out here! You're the quiet one, you see through this, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Servas,,@Jonathan's silence is no longer a sanctuary; it is a vote of no confidence in May.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
